    ideaNote: "and one more thing, really important: write to me about literally everything — a feature you're missing, something you'd like to change, something inconvenient, something that doesn't work. i know everyone got used to writing to a developer and it goes nowhere, and that nobody will build anything for just one person — here it's different, i read everything, and if i like the idea or it's objectively useful for the plugin, in most cases it will be made (if it's technically possible at all). so don't be shy, even if it seems only you need it or it's some small thing — write",
